67
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:23,900
 mireu, començaré explicant el per què es valla,

68
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:26,540
 per què hi ha aquests valls tradicionals,

69
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:27,680
 vull dir, aquí a Andorra.

70
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:31,200
 A les zones d'alta muntanya,

71
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,180
 vull dir, sobretot al Pirineu,

72
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,840
 entre els quals, evidentment, no cal dir-ho,

73
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,700
 que som a Andorra.

74
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:41,980
 És a dir, la gent d'aquí,

75
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,660
 no sé que fossis un hereu

76
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,520
